        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Cwo me je jobedo i hongo pa Joyakim, wod Yesuwa aka nyakwar Yehozadak, kodi Nehemia gavana, kodi i hongo pa Ezira, jacway ri Were i wi migam m'oyido obedo jafonji Cik.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Nehemia ketho kor Ot i cingi Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Munyo iketho kor ot ma tindi madwoŋ i cingi Were, olwoŋi Jolevi wok i kisi kabedo pajo bino i kalima gi miyo foyo gi wer kodi forok ka jotuko tongol, adungu kodi gi wer man. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jolevi jocokere wok kam'oyido jobed'iye thoko Yerusalem kodi wok i tindin thoko Netofa, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi wok i Bethgilgal, Geba, kodi Azimaveth. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi Jolevi jotimo kwer ma lonyo jo, ji, waŋkace, kodi kor ot ma tindi madwoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo an, Nehemia, akelo jotel ma Yuda i wi kor ot, aka amiyo jo telo kitipin ario ma joŋanjo thoko tindi madwoŋ i wi kor ot, ka jomiyo Were foyo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitipa acel okadho yuracam tundo i Waŋkac ma Woyo, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka Hosaya kodi adec ma jodhum joluwo jo cen. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.32"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo oluwo jocway ri Were i wi migam: Azaria, Ezira, Mesulam, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yuda, Benyamin, Samaya, kodi Yeremia, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "joje oyido jokudho gwarin. Ŋat'oluwo obedo Zekaria, wod Yonathan aka nyakwar Samaya aka janono pa Asaf. Kwarere pere man jobedo: Matania, Mikaya, kodi Zakur. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.35"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "36",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:36"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "36",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kenyo oluwo jonono pa Asaf man: Samaya, Azarel Milalai, Gilalai, Mai, Nethanel, Yuda, kodi Hanani, joje oyido jotiŋo gi wer pa Kere Daudi, jacwo pa Were. Ezira jafonji Cik otelo kitipa me. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.36",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.36"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I Waŋkac ma Kidiwa, joidho madala malo kadho i Tindi madwoŋ pa Daudi, kalo peco pa Daudi, gik i kor ot i Waŋkac ma Waŋ pi, i thenge ma yuwok ceŋ ma tindi madwoŋ.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "37",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:37"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "37",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.37",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.37"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "38",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:38"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "38",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kitipa mar'ario pa ji ma jomiyo foyo joluwo yuracuc i wi kor ot, aka aluwo jo, kanyacel gi adec man pa jotel ma Yuda. Wakadho kalo Acurcur ma Oven, kiri i Kor ot ma Woko, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.38",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.38"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka wok kenyo wakadho kalo Waŋkac pa Efrayim, Waŋkac pa Yesana, Waŋkac ma Rec, Acurcur ma Hananel, Acurcur ma Miya, kiri i Waŋkac ma Rombo. Wacungo cegin gi waŋkac ma Ot pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "39",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:39"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "39",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.39",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.39"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ameno kitipin ario je m'oyido jomiyo Were foyo joromo ruwaŋ Ot pa Were.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "40",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:40"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "40",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I kitipa paran oyido nitie adec ma jodhum, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.40",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.40"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "41",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:41"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "41",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kodi jocway ri Were i wi migam me m'oyido jokudho gwara: Eliakim, Maseya, Miniamin, Mikaya, Eliowenay, Zekaria, kodi Hanania; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.41",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.41"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aka cwo me oyido joluwo jo: Maseya, Samaya, Eliazar, Uzi, Yehohanan, Malikija, Elam, kodi Ezer. Yezrahia am'oyido telo jower.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "42",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:42"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "42",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.42",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.42"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no omiy cowirok madwoŋ aka ji oyido jofore kwoŋbedo Were omiyo jo kisangala. Mon kodi nyithindho bende jofore, aka kisangala pa Yerusalem owinjere bor swa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Tic ma Ot pa Were",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "43",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:43"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.43",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.43"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "44",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:44"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "44",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I ndelo no oyer cwo bedo jotel ma kisikin ma kano mic ma Ot pa Were, kiri gi acel wiy apar, kodi ŋano marapena gi olemo macek kisi oro. Cwo me oyido joripo coko mic pa jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi Jolevi wok i ndelin macegin gi tindin madongo paka Cik waco. Ji ma Yuda je oyido josangala gi jocway ri Were i wi migam kodi Jolevi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.44",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.44"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "45",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:45"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "45",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.25.1+1CH.25.2+1CH.25.3+1CH.25.4+1CH.25.5+1CH.25.6+1CH.25.7+1CH.25.8"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kigana 25:1-8",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "1CH.26.12"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "1 Kigana 26:12",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "kwoŋbedo oyido jotimo kwer ma lonyo ji kodi tic man ri Were pajo. Jower kodi jokur ma Ot pa Were bende jotimo tic pajo paka Kere Daudi kodi wode Solomon joketho cik. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.45",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.45"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "46",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:46"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "46",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wok i hongo pa Kere Daudi kodi jawer Asaf cango con, oyido nitie jatel pa jower kodi wer ma pak kodi ma miyo Were foyo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.46",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.46"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "47",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 12:47"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "47",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "I hongo pa Zerubabel kodi i hongo pa Yeremia, Joisiraili je jomiyo mic ma kisi ndelo ma thielo jower kodi jokur ma Ot pa Were. Ji jomiyo Jolevi mic pajo, aka Jolevi jomiyo jocway ri Were i wi migam mic pajo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.12.47",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.12.47"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
